# -*- encoding: utf-8 -*-
# Arc: HollowWorld | Scene: TheHollowWorldWarrior5

translate pt strings:

    old "A laughter, interbroken with a choking sound from his lungs could be heard throughout the cave."
    new "Um riso, interrompido por um som sufocante que saía de seus pulmões, podia ser ouvido em toda a caverna."

    old "A madman in a cave, rambling about his divine friends."
    new "Um louco numa caverna, delirando sobre seus amigos divinos."

    old "A gift, from my friends. Or perhaps payment for my services now rendered."
    new "Um presente, de meus amigos. Ou talvez um pagamento pelos serviços que acabei de prestar."

    old "A frenzy took hold of her as she continued her march, up and up the hill, faster and faster."
    new "Uma frenesi apossou-se dela enquanto ela continuava sua marcha, subindo e subindo a colina, mais rápido e mais rápido."

    old "A dullness had been lifted, and Sarah prayed it would remain forever banished."
    new "Uma névoa havia sido dissipada, e Sarah orou para que permanecesse banida para sempre."
